# Fedora COPR Repositories & Flathub Configuration
#
# Primary Hyprland stack COPR. nett00n/hyprland is automated for
# Fedora 43/44/45 (x86_64 + aarch64) and replaces the abandoned
# upstream Hyprland COPR.
# Covers: hyprland, hyprpaper, hyprlock, hypridle, hyprpicker,
#         hyprsunset, hyprland-guiutils, xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland,
#         quickshell, uwsm
nett00n/hyprland

# Omarchy first-party binaries, source-built for Fedora.
# Covers: aether, cliamp, disktree-bin, elsewhen, gliff, herdr, hype,
#         hyprland-preview-share-picker, monologue, omacalc, omacut,
#         omapresent, omarchy-emacs, omarchy-hyprland-titlebars, omasnap,
#         omawrite, owe, owe-lockfeed, signed, superwhisper-bin, try,
#         ttfx, voxtype-bin
whelanh/omarchy

# Ghostty Terminal — REQUIRED: ghostty is in the base manifest and is NOT
# packaged in official Fedora. Verified building for fedora-44 x86_64.
scottames/ghostty

# Starship prompt — not packaged in official Fedora; documented upstream
# method is this COPR. Verified building for fedora-44 x86_64.
atim/starship

# Lazygit — not in Fedora 44 repos. Dedicated COPR tracking upstream.
# Verified building for fedora-44 x86_64.
boobaa/lazygit

# Mise runtime manager — required by Omarchy dev-env and agent stubs.
# Verified building for fedora-44 x86_64.
jdxcode/mise

# LocalSend — LAN file sharing (Super + Ctrl + S).
# Verified building for fedora-44 x86_64.
anudeepd/localsend

# GPU Screen Recorder — hardware-accelerated Wayland screen recording.
# Verified building for fedora-44 x86_64.
brycensranch/gpu-screen-recorder-git

# Moonlight Qt — GameStream / Sunshine client preinstall.
# Verified building for fedora-44 x86_64.
lecris/moonlight

# Flathub Repository URL for Desktop Flatpak Apps
FLATHUB_URL=https://dl.flathub.org/repo/flathub.flatpakrepo
